-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The licence above covers this repository's own work: the build engine, the Lua
filters, the templates, the LaTeX styles written for it, the authoring
standards and the demo chapter.

It does NOT cover `latex/sleek/`, which vendors two files from a third party's
LaTeX style, recorded in `latex/sleek/README.md` along with every modification
made to them. Those files remain under whatever terms their author set. As of
this writing the upstream repository named in that README could not be reached
and no licence statement accompanies the files, so their terms are unverified;
anyone redistributing this repository should establish them, or replace the two
files, before relying on the licence above for that directory.
